      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "鹤川为什么要质问我这件事呢？",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Why did Tsurukawa have to question me about this?",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kinkakuji-p00482",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "是出于友情吗？",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Was it out of friendship?",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kinkakuji-p00482",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "他知道不知道这样质问我，就会抛弃了他自己的真正的职责？",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Did he realize that by questioning me like this, he would be abandoning his own true duty?",
          "g": "predicate"
