    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kinkakuji-p00482",
      "unit_index": 4,
      "source_text": "他知道不知道他的这种质问，在我心灵深处背叛了我？",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Did he realize that this questioning of his betrayed me deep in my heart?",
